      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let’s get the products out there with a small AD campaign. You can do this either with Facebook, Google Ad Words, or Apple App Store (I’ve never tried this last one but feel free to experiment). The more targeted the advertising the more results you’ll see. Facebook Ads are pretty easy - you create a FB page for your product and then “boost” a post - you can target very specific user demographics, set a target time limit for your campaign, and a max budget. Let’s keep our budget to $15.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
